cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this result, please cite it as below."
title: "G63 Max-Cut: a publicly verifiable solution of 27,050"
abstract: "A publicly verifiable Max-Cut configuration of value 27,050 for the G-set instance G63 (7,000 vertices, 41,459 edges), found with population annealing Monte Carlo on a consumer GPU (NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti); includes independent verifiers and checksums. Version 1.1.0 corrects version 1.0.0: 27,050 is not the highest reported value for G63. An explicit public configuration of value 27,052 was published by Ota and Okada (Zenodo, March 2026, doi:10.5281/zenodo.19189885), and an earlier report of 27,052 for the Fujitsu Digital Annealer has been pointed out to us (not yet verified by us)."
